@startuml
title SystemHealth Agent Chat Flow

actor User
participant "Dashboard UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI /api/chat\napp/api/chat.py" as ChatAPI
participant "Hub\nlive snapshots" as Hub
participant "Context Builder\napp/agent/diagnose.py" as Context
participant "KB Engine\napp/agent/kb.py" as KB
participant "Embedding Model\napp/agent/embed.py" as Embed
database "FAISS Index" as FAISS
participant "LLM Router\napp/agent/llm.py" as LLM
participant "Ollama / llama.cpp" as Model
collections "data/kb/*.md" as KBFiles

== Startup / KB build ==
ChatAPI -> KB: build()
KB -> KBFiles: scan *.md
KBFiles --> KB: markdown docs
KB -> KB: parse title/tags/steps/full text
alt FAISS + embedding model available
  KB -> Embed: embed(doc texts)
  Embed --> KB: vectors
  KB -> FAISS: build / refresh index
  KB -> KBFiles: write meta.json + faiss.index
else KB deps unavailable
  KB -> KB: disable semantic KB search
end

== User message ==
User -> UI: type chat message
UI -> ChatAPI: POST /api/chat\nmessages[] + optional scope
ChatAPI -> ChatAPI: extract latest user message

== Layer 1: direct live answer ==
ChatAPI -> Hub: latest("system")
ChatAPI -> Hub: latest("jetson")
ChatAPI -> Hub: latest("health")
ChatAPI -> Hub: latest("crashes")
ChatAPI -> Hub: latest("processes")
Hub --> ChatAPI: latest snapshots
ChatAPI -> ChatAPI: _direct_answer(question)

alt direct answer found and no LLM configured
  ChatAPI --> UI: {answer, backend="direct"}
  UI --> User: render response

else no direct answer and no LLM configured
  ChatAPI -> Context: collect_context(scope)
  Context -> Hub: latest(system/health/processes/crashes)
  Context --> ChatAPI: context dict
  ChatAPI -> ChatAPI: _digest_text(context)

  ChatAPI -> KB: query(question + digest)
  alt KB index exists
    KB -> Embed: embed(query)
    Embed --> KB: query vector
    KB -> FAISS: similarity search
    FAISS --> KB: top matches
    KB --> ChatAPI: KB matches
    ChatAPI -> ChatAPI: _kb_answer(...)
  else KB disabled / empty
    KB --> ChatAPI: no matches
  end

  alt KB answer found
    ChatAPI --> UI: {answer, backend="kb"}
  else no KB answer
    ChatAPI --> UI: {answer="No LLM configured...\nLive system snapshot: ...", backend="none"}
  end
  UI --> User: render response

else LLM configured
  == Build context ==
  ChatAPI -> Context: collect_context(scope)
  Context -> Hub: latest(system/health/processes/crashes)
  Context --> ChatAPI: context dict
  ChatAPI -> ChatAPI: _digest_text(context)

  == KB lookup ==
  ChatAPI -> KB: query(question + digest)
  alt KB index exists
    KB -> Embed: embed(query)
    Embed --> KB: query vector
    KB -> FAISS: similarity search
    FAISS --> KB: top matches
    KB --> ChatAPI: KB matches
    ChatAPI -> ChatAPI: _kb_answer(...)
  else KB disabled / empty
    KB --> ChatAPI: no matches
  end

  == Compose LLM prompt ==
  ChatAPI -> ChatAPI: build context_prefix\n[direct data] + [live digest] + [KB] + chat history
  ChatAPI -> LLM: chat(messages, system prompt)

  alt Ollama configured
    LLM -> Model: POST /api/chat
    Model --> LLM: generated reply
    LLM --> ChatAPI: {text, backend="ollama"}
  else llama.cpp configured
    LLM -> Model: POST /completion
    Model --> LLM: generated reply
    LLM --> ChatAPI: {text, backend="llama.cpp"}
  else no backend
    LLM --> ChatAPI: {text="no LLM configured", backend="none"}
  end

  alt LLM success
    ChatAPI -> ChatAPI: maybe tag backend with +direct
    alt no KB answer and LLM produced answer
      ChatAPI -> ChatAPI: _maybe_save_kb_stub(question, answer, digest)
      ChatAPI -> KBFiles: write auto_<slug>.md
    end
    ChatAPI --> UI: {answer, backend, model, latency_ms}
  else LLM exception
    ChatAPI -> ChatAPI: fallback = direct or kb or digest
    ChatAPI --> UI: {answer=fallback, backend="direct+kb_fallback", note=error}
  end

  UI --> User: render response
end

== KB reload ==
User -> UI: trigger KB reload
UI -> ChatAPI: POST /api/kb/reload
ChatAPI -> KB: build(force=True)
KB -> KBFiles: rescan *.md
KB -> Embed: re-embed docs
KB -> FAISS: rebuild index
ChatAPI --> UI: {ok: true, entries: N}

@enduml
